Port 22
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
Protocol 2
HostKey /keys/host_key
PidFile /run/sshd.pid
AuthorizedKeysFile /run/sshd/authorized_keys

PermitRootLogin no
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthenticationMethods publickey
UsePAM no

AllowUsers agentdemo
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
GatewayPorts no
PermitUserEnvironment no
PermitUserRC no
PermitTTY no
MaxAuthTries 2
MaxSessions 1
MaxStartups 2:30:4
LogLevel VERBOSE

Match User agentdemo
    ForceCommand /usr/local/bin/sandboxd-forced-command
